paragraphs:
“He will feign peace toward all men and craftily draw many into his friendship.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0502.htm
)

“The Antichrist shall pretend to establish peace and harmony among all nations, yet in him shall iniquity abound.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0103525.htm
)

“They cry for peace while persecuting righteousness; this is not peace but preparation for judgment.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0301.htm
)
